      "rationale": "Constructor equation defining isNumericVal to be true on Float values; it contributes directly to the predicate definition and replaces no fixed-semantics execution.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-f1ada8e553470df79e923850e9a82e4ade7d8b82de56eded497f90ba526c9b0a",
      "start_line": 11,
      "text": "  rule isNumericVal(_:Float) => true"
