      "rationale": "The owise equation completes the total definition of isNumericVal by returning false for every remaining Val constructor; it is definitional case coverage, not a trusted mathematical fact.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-304ee5c0da386cdc923ba4c73cc1f6dd81caf237937dabfdc90aeed8214fa4c2",
      "start_line": 12,
      "text": "  rule isNumericVal(_:Val)   => false [owise]"
